  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "PatternStack watches this project’s dependencies for lifecycle changes\nthe ecosystem made: deprecations, abandonment (no releases, maintenance\nmode), supersessions, and breaking majors. These are changes you will\nNOT find by searching, because nothing prompts the search.\n\nAt the START of a coding session, call project.deltas (or project.sync\nafter the manifest changed) to learn what shifted since the last session.\nBefore adding a new dependency, call dependency.health for its current\nlifecycle state. Treat any ‘deprecated’, ‘stagnant’, or needs-attention\nresult as generation context: do not scaffold flagged packages; prefer\nthe listed successor.\n\nKeep the managed dependency-rules block current: after register/sync\n(or when sync returns rulesBlockChanged), call rules.export and replace\nthe content between the patternstack:rules markers in AGENTS.md (or\nCLAUDE.md), creating the block at the end of the file if absent.",
  "durationMs": 11182,
  "stderr": "🪸 PatternStack MCP started\n🔑 No API key — anonymous mode: package lookups (dependency.health, dependency.alternatives, lifecycle.state) work; watching this repo needs a free key from https://patternstack.ai/dashboard/projects\n📦 Watching /pkg/package.json (npm, 1 packages)\n"
}
